  <p>A high-performance Go implementation of the DTRules decision table rules engine.</p>

  <h2>Overview</h2>

  <p>The Go implementation provides:</p>

  <ul>
    <li><strong>Full compatibility</strong> with DTRules XML formats (EDD and Decision Tables)</li>
    <li><strong>High performance</strong> with zero-allocation hot paths</li>
    <li><strong>Dual execution modes</strong>: Object-based (compatible) and Value-based (optimized)</li>
    <li><strong>330+ operators</strong> covering math, boolean, string, array, date, and control flow operations</li>
  </ul>

