  <h2>Decision Table Types</h2>

  <ul>
    <li><strong>BALANCED</strong>: All condition branches must be defined</li>
    <li><strong>FIRST</strong>: Executes only the first matching column</li>
    <li><strong>ALL</strong>: Executes all matching columns in order</li>
  </ul>

